{"seq":1,"slug":"spectrum-atmosphere","title":"电磁波谱与大气窗口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/geography-geopolitics/remote-sensing/physics/spectrum-atmosphere","wordCount":1518,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"电磁波谱与大气窗口\">电磁波谱与大气窗口</h1><p>遥感之所以能在数百公里高空&quot;看见&quot;地表，靠的不是光学魔法，而是一条朴素的物理链条：地物要么反射太阳辐射、要么自身发射热辐射，这些电磁波穿过大气抵达传感器。理解这条链条的起点，是搞清楚电磁波谱的分区，以及大气在哪些波段&quot;透明&quot;、哪些波段&quot;不透明&quot;。波段选择不是工程师的自由发挥，而是被大气吸收谱线和地物辐射特性共同框定的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>电磁波是同相振荡的电场与磁场在空间传播的能量形式。在真空中它以光速 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mtext>m/s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c \\approx 3 \\times 10^8\\,\\text{m/s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m/s</span></span></span></span></span></span> 传播，波长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>、频率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ν</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span></span></span></span></span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>ν</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c = \\lambda\\nu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span></span></span></span></span>。遥感关心的不是单一波长，而是从紫外到微波的一段连续谱。每个波段携带的信息不同：可见光反映色彩与植被状态，近红外刻画植被结构与含水量，热红外测量地表温度，微波则能穿云透雨、对粗糙度和介电常数敏感。</p>\n<p>下图给出遥感涉及的主要波段及其典型用途：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[太阳辐射 + 地球热辐射] --&gt; B[紫外 0.3-0.4um&lt;br/&gt;荧光 臭氧]&#10;  A --&gt; C[可见光 0.4-0.7um&lt;br/&gt;色彩 水体 植被]&#10;  A --&gt; D[近红外 0.7-1.3um&lt;br/&gt;植被结构 含水量]&#10;  A --&gt; E[短波红外 1.3-3um&lt;br/&gt;矿物 土壤湿度]&#10;  A --&gt; F[热红外 3-14um&lt;br/&gt;地表温度 火点]&#10;  A --&gt; G[微波 1mm-1m&lt;br/&gt;穿云 粗糙度 介电]&#10;  B --&gt; H[传感器接收]&#10;  C --&gt; H&#10;  D --&gt; H&#10;  E --&gt; H&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H\">graph TD\n  A[太阳辐射 + 地球热辐射] --&gt; B[紫外 0.3-0.4um&lt;br/&gt;荧光 臭氧]\n  A --&gt; C[可见光 0.4-0.7um&lt;br/&gt;色彩 水体 植被]\n  A --&gt; D[近红外 0.7-1.3um&lt;br/&gt;植被结构 含水量]\n  A --&gt; E[短波红外 1.3-3um&lt;br/&gt;矿物 土壤湿度]\n  A --&gt; F[热红外 3-14um&lt;br/&gt;地表温度 火点]\n  A --&gt; G[微波 1mm-1m&lt;br/&gt;穿云 粗糙度 介电]\n  B --&gt; H[传感器接收]\n  C --&gt; H\n  D --&gt; H\n  E --&gt; H\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H</pre><p>不同波段的波长、频率与遥感价值对比如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>波段</th>\n<th>波长范围</th>\n<th>主要辐射来源</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>可见光</td>\n<td>0.4–0.7 μm</td>\n<td>太阳反射</td>\n<td>真彩色成像、水质、城市制图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>近红外 NIR</td>\n<td>0.7–1.3 μm</td>\n<td>太阳反射</td>\n<td>植被指数、生物量、水陆边界</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>短波红外 SWIR</td>\n<td>1.3–3 μm</td>\n<td>太阳反射</td>\n<td>土壤湿度、矿物识别、火烧迹地</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中波/热红外</td>\n<td>3–14 μm</td>\n<td>地表自身发射</td>\n<td>地表温度、火灾、夜间成像</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微波</td>\n<td>1 mm–1 m</td>\n<td>主动发射或地表发射</td>\n<td>SAR 成像、土壤水分、海面风场</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"黑体辐射与维恩位移定律\">黑体辐射与维恩位移定律</h2><p>要理解为什么可见光波段以反射为主、热红外波段以发射为主，需要回到黑体辐射。任何温度高于绝对零度的物体都向外辐射电磁波，其辐射强度随波长的分布由普朗克定律给出。辐射峰值波长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与物体温度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 成反比，这就是维恩位移定律：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mi>T</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>b</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>2898</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mtext>m</mtext><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>K</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{\\max} = \\frac{b}{T}, \\quad b \\approx 2898\\,\\mu\\text{m}\\cdot\\text{K}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2898</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">K</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>太阳表面温度约 5800 K，代入得峰值波长约 0.5 μm，正落在可见光绿光附近——这解释了为何人眼与多数光学传感器都把工作重心放在可见光到近红外。地球表面温度约 300 K，峰值波长约 9.7 μm，正落在热红外窗口，所以测地表温度必须用热红外通道。两个辐射源在波长轴上几乎不重叠，约在 3–4 μm 处交汇，这一交汇点正是中波红外既含反射又含发射成分、处理上最棘手的原因。地物自身发射的能量总量则由斯特藩-玻尔兹曼定律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ε</mi><mi>σ</mi><msup><mi>T</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M = \\varepsilon \\sigma T^4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 描述，其中发射率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 的取值是热红外定量反演的关键，详见 <a href=\"radiative-transfer-calibration\">辐射传输与定标</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"大气窗口的形成\">大气窗口的形成</h2><p>大气并非对所有波长一视同仁。水汽（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>O</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{H}_2\\text{O}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span></span></span></span></span>）、二氧化碳（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）、臭氧（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>O</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{O}_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）等气体分子在特定波长有强烈的吸收带，把这些波段的辐射几乎全部截留。剩下那些大气透过率高的波段，就是&quot;大气窗口&quot;——遥感传感器的波段几乎全部安排在这些窗口里。</p>\n<p>主要大气窗口包括：可见光至近红外（0.4–1.3 μm，透过率常超 80%）、几个被水汽吸收带分隔的短波红外窗口（1.55–1.75 μm、2.05–2.4 μm）、中波红外窗口（3–5 μm）、热红外窗口（8–14 μm，但 9.6 μm 处有臭氧吸收）、以及微波区（波长大于约 2 cm 后大气几乎完全透明）。正因为微波几乎不受大气吸收和云雨散射影响，<a href=\"../sensors-platforms/sar\">合成孔径雷达 SAR</a> 才能实现全天候、全天时观测。</p>\n<p>设计一个新波段时的判断流程如下：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[目标地物的诊断性光谱特征在哪个波长?] --&gt; B{该波长处&lt;br/&gt;大气透过率高吗?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否 落在吸收带| C[放弃或选邻近窗口]&#10;  B --&gt;|是 落在窗口| D{以反射还是发射为主?}&#10;  D --&gt;|反射 短于3um| E[需太阳光照&lt;br/&gt;白天观测]&#10;  D --&gt;|发射 长于4um| F[可昼夜观测&lt;br/&gt;需定标发射率]&#10;  E --&gt; G[确定波段中心与带宽]&#10;  F --&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n  A[目标地物的诊断性光谱特征在哪个波长?] --&gt; B{该波长处&lt;br/&gt;大气透过率高吗?}\n  B --&gt;|否 落在吸收带| C[放弃或选邻近窗口]\n  B --&gt;|是 落在窗口| D{以反射还是发射为主?}\n  D --&gt;|反射 短于3um| E[需太阳光照&lt;br/&gt;白天观测]\n  D --&gt;|发射 长于4um| F[可昼夜观测&lt;br/&gt;需定标发射率]\n  E --&gt; G[确定波段中心与带宽]\n  F --&gt; G</pre><h2 id=\"散射-吸收与路径辐射\">散射、吸收与路径辐射</h2><p>辐射穿过大气时除了被吸收，还会被分子和气溶胶散射，改变传播方向。瑞利散射由远小于波长的气体分子引起，散射强度与波长四次方成反比（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∝</mo><msup><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\propto \\lambda^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），所以短波长的蓝光被散射得最强——天空呈蓝色、遥感影像的蓝波段雾霾最重，都是它的后果。米氏散射由尺寸与波长相当的气溶胶、尘埃、水滴引起，对波长依赖较弱，是雾霾天影像整体发灰的主因。</p>\n<p>这些散射带来一个棘手问题：传感器接收到的辐射里，混入了从未触及地表、仅由大气散射进入视场的&quot;路径辐射&quot;。它抬高了影像的整体亮度、压低了对比度，尤其污染蓝波段。把路径辐射和大气吸收的影响从信号中剥离、还原地表真实反射率，正是大气校正要解决的核心任务，其方法体系在 <a href=\"radiative-transfer-calibration\">辐射传输与定标</a> 与 <a href=\"../image-analysis/geometric-radiometric-correction\">几何与辐射校正</a> 中展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>遥感的物理基础是地物对太阳辐射的反射与自身的热发射，两类信号在波长轴上以约 3–4 μm 为界分野。</li>\n<li>维恩位移定律解释了波段分工：太阳辐射峰值在可见光（约 0.5 μm），地球辐射峰值在热红外（约 9.7 μm）。</li>\n<li>大气窗口由水汽、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>O</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{O}_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的吸收带切割而成，传感器波段必须避开吸收带、落在窗口内。</li>\n<li>微波几乎不受大气吸收与云雨散射影响，是 SAR 全天候观测的物理前提。</li>\n<li>瑞利散射（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∝</mo><msup><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\propto \\lambda^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）与米氏散射制造了路径辐射，是大气校正必须剥离的干扰项。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"电磁波谱与大气窗口","id":"电磁波谱与大气窗口"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"黑体辐射与维恩位移定律","id":"黑体辐射与维恩位移定律"},{"level":2,"text":"大气窗口的形成","id":"大气窗口的形成"},{"level":2,"text":"散射、吸收与路径辐射","id":"散射-吸收与路径辐射"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"辐射传输与定标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/geography-geopolitics/remote-sensing/physics/radiative-transfer-calibration"}}